# The Wandering Minstrel, the other order (CR 616.1): Bot1 puts Ishgard, the Holy See and is asked which replacement applies
# first; it takes the Minstrel's "lands you control enter untapped" first, then the land's own "This land enters tapped"
# applies, and it enters tapped (the ruling: the land's controller may choose it enters tapped or untapped).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
The Wandering Minstrel
Ishgard, the Holy See
Forest x3
Forest x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.The Wandering Minstrel.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ishgard, the Holy See.Play
Bot1.Replace(lands you control enter untapped)
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ishgard, the Holy See.Tapped = true
